# UI

Use Chakra UI for layout, tabs, drawer, menu, modal, form controls, and theme.

Use Cutoff Audio UI for audio controls: knobs, sliders, meters, audio parameter controls.

- Never use Chakra `Slider` for plugin parameters unless Cutoff cannot do it.
- Wrap Cutoff controls in shared components — `AudioKnob`, `AudioSlider`, `AudioMeter` — never scatter raw Cutoff controls throughout the project.

## State

- React is never the source of truth; render from kit state pushed by C++ and request changes via the bridge.
- Keep business logic out of React components.
